762	{
763	    /// Here we check whether `index_column_node` is `arrayElement(m, ...)` (i.e. `m['key']`)
764	    /// and a text index is defined for `mapValues(m)`. If so, the index on the map values
765	    /// can be used to skip granules because `arrayElement(m, 'const_key')` projects the
