781	{
782	    /// Here we check whether we can use index defined for `mapValues(m)`
783	    /// for functions like `func(arrayElement(m, 'const_key'), ...)`.
784	    /// If index can be used, than we can analyze the index as for scalar string column
785	    /// because `arrayElement(m, 'const_key')` projects Array(String) to String.
